@startuml DolphinScheduler-SPI-Flow

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false

title DolphinScheduler SPI 核心流程图

' ============================================
' 垂直流程 - 清晰展示层次
' ============================================

component [业务代码\n需求: 获取 MySQL 连接(SqlTask)] as Business #FFFDE7

component [DataSourceClientProvider\n门面层\n---\ngetPooledConnection()\ngetAdHocConnection()] as Provider #FFE0B2

rectangle "管理层" #FFF9C4 {
    component [DataSourcePluginManager\n---\nMap<String, Channel>\nget("mysql")] as PluginMgr
    
    component [DataSourceProcessorProvider\n---\nget(DbType)] as ProcessorPvd
}

rectangle "SPI 契约层" #E3F2FD {
    component [DataSourceChannel\n---\ncreateAdHocClient()\ncreatePooledClient()] as Channel
    
    component [BaseConnectionParam\n---\nuser, password\naddress, database\njdbcUrl, driver] as Params
}

rectangle "策略实现层" #E8F5E9 {
    component [BaseAdHocDataSourceClient\n---\ngetConnection():\n1. 获取 Processor\n2. Processor.getConnection()\n3. 返回新连接] as AdHoc #FFCDD2
    
    component [BasePooledDataSourceClient\n---\nHikariDataSource pool\n---\ngetConnection():\n1. pool.getConnection()\n2. 返回池化连接] as Pooled #C5E1A5
}

component [DataSourceProcessor\n处理器层\n---\ngetConnection(params)\ngetJdbcUrl()\ngetValidationQuery()] as Processor #F8BBD0

component [MySQL 插件\nPostgreSQL 插件\nOracle 插件\n... 28种数据源] as Impls #C8E6C9

component [java.sql.Connection\n最终目标] as Conn #B3E5FC

' ============================================
' 主流程 - 清晰的单向流
' ============================================

Business -down-> Provider : 1.调用

Provider -down-> PluginMgr : 2.获取 Channel

PluginMgr -down-> Channel : 3.返回

Channel -down-> AdHoc : 4a.创建 AdHoc Client
Channel -down-> Pooled : 4b.创建 Pooled Client

Channel .right.> Params : 传递参数

AdHoc -down-> ProcessorPvd : 5.获取 Processor
ProcessorPvd -down-> Processor : 6.返回

Processor -down-> Impls : 7.具体实现

AdHoc -down-> Conn : 8a.返回新连接
Pooled -down-> Conn : 8b.返回池化连接

Conn -up-> Business : 9.业务使用

' ============================================
' 注释说明
' ============================================

note right of Provider
    【门面模式】
    业务统一入口
    
    只依赖:
    PluginManager
end note

note right of PluginMgr
    【管理器】
    启动时通过 SPI
    加载所有 Channel
    
    Map 存储:
    mysql → MySQLChannel
    postgresql → PGChannel
end note

note right of AdHoc
    【临时连接】
    每次创建新连接
    
    依赖 ProcessorProvider
    适合测试场景
end note

note right of Pooled
    【池化连接】
    维护连接池
    
    不需要 Processor
    适合生产环境
end note

note right of Processor
    【适配器】
    适配不同数据库
    
    每个数据源提供
    一个实现
end note

legend bottom
    【核心流程】
    
    1. 业务调用 Provider
    2. Provider 从 PluginManager 获取 Channel
    3. Channel 根据策略创建 Client
    4. AdHoc Client 通过 Processor 创建连接
    5. Pooled Client 从连接池获取连接
    6. 返回 Connection 给业务使用
    
    【两种路径】
    AdHoc: Business → Provider → Channel → AdHoc → Processor → Connection
    Pooled: Business → Provider → Channel → Pooled → Connection
endlegend

@enduml
